    "description": "<p><em>(Cheetah, Lion, Panther, etc)</em><br><strong>Instinct</strong> +1 <strong>Evasion</strong> +3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> Melee Instinct d8+4 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Gain Advantage on</strong>: attack, climb, sneak</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Fleet</strong>: Spend a Hope to move up to Far range without rolling.</p>\n<p><strong>Takedown</strong>: Mark a Stress to move into Melee range of a target and make an attack roll against them. On a success, deal an additional 2d8 damage with this attack and the target marks a Stress.</p>\n<p><strong>Sturdy</strong>: When you take Severe+ damage, you drop out of Beastform.</p>\n",
